routing.home-brief-day-shaper:
# AGENTS

When the day's shape is ready:
  @Brief Editor, please take the ordered list with the fixed points marked.
When a commitment needs something that has not been done:
  @Loose Ends Tracker, please tell me whether that preparation is still outstanding.

routing.home-brief-editor:
# AGENTS

When an overnight change needs its source checked:
  @Signal Scout, please confirm the source and the time this changed.
When the day's commitments are unclear:
  @Day Shaper, please give me the ordered list with the fixed points marked.
When something from an earlier brief has not moved:
  @Loose Ends Tracker, please tell me whether this is still owed and by whom.

routing.home-brief-loose-ends:
# AGENTS

When an overdue item needs to be in front of the reader:
  @Brief Editor, please include this one, with its age noted.
When a commitment depends on something in today's calendar:
  @Day Shaper, please tell me whether today makes this possible.

routing.home-brief-signal-scout:
# AGENTS

When a change is confirmed and dated:
  @Brief Editor, please decide whether this belongs in today's brief.
When a change affects something already promised:
  @Loose Ends Tracker, please check whether this closes an outstanding item.
